# BlogCMS API requests collection (VS Code "REST Client" extension; also readable in JetBrains HTTP Client).
#
# Run the happy path top to bottom: create -> publish -> list -> filter -> delete.
# Request chaining (`createPost.response...`) is a REST Client feature. In JetBrains, replace
# the `postId` and `livePostId` values below with the ids returned by "Create a post" and
# "Create directly as published".
#
# Start the API first (`npm run dev` or `docker compose up --build`).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = brianfox-cms-token
@postId = {{createPost.response.body.data.id}}
@livePostId = {{createLive.response.body.data.id}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- System

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Happy path

### 1. Create a post (draft by default, author is always "Brian Fox") -> 201 + Location
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: demo-create-1

{
  "title": "Hello BlogCMS",
  "body": "My first post",
  "hashtags": ["#NodeJS", "typescript"]
}

### 2. Publish it -> 200 (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts/{{postId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Reader: list published posts -> 200 (try again with If-None-Match for a 304)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts

### 4. Reader: filter by hashtag, any of the tags (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?hashtags=nodejs,rust&match=any

### 5. Reader: filter by hashtag, all of the tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?hashtags=nodejs,typescript&match=all

### 6. Reader: a literal # must be sent as %23
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?hashtags=%23NodeJS

### 7. Reader: get one published post
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}

### 8. Delete the post -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- More CMS calls

### Create directly as published (its id is used by the calls below; post 1 was deleted above)
# @name createLive
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Live", "body": "Already public", "status": "published", "hashtags": ["news"] }

### List everything, drafts included (filters: status, hashtags, match, page, limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts?status=draft&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get any post, drafts included
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts/{{livePostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update title, body and/or hashtags (status and author cannot be changed here)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts/{{livePostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "New title", "hashtags": ["updated"] }

### Unpublish (back to draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts/{{livePostId}}/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pagination

### Reader: page 2 with 5 items per page (limit is capped at 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?page=2&limit=5

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Error cases

### 401 - missing token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts

### 401 - wrong token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts
Authorization: Bearer wrong-token

### 400 - validation error (empty title, body missing, bad hashtag)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "hashtags": ["not valid!"] }

### 400 - malformed JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": 

### 400 - invalid query (page must be >= 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?page=0

### 400 - PATCH rejects unknown fields such as status or author
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts/{{livePostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "published" }

### 404 - post that does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/64b7f0f0f0f0f0f0f0f0f0f0

### 404 - malformed id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/not-an-id

### 404 - unknown route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/nothing-here

### 415 - body that is not JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cms/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: text/plain

just text
